    "content_hash": "8fcc1b3d38ace027583b8577cf44ad44b56ad638693a96210fc5ce5aa8dbd394",
    "text": "Measurement of plasma natriuretic peptide level (BNP or NT-proBNP) is recommended as an initial diagnostic test (Class I, Level B).",
    "table_data": null,
    "section_id": "sec_3_1",
    "heading_level": null,
    "breadcrumb": "3. Diagnostic pathway for patients with suspected heart failure > 3.1. Diagnostic tests",
