    "content_hash": "e999fa6e95e2ddb341cbc81abfc64aabd2400bb1e9fa034d98ae30af9fd43c13",
    "text": "Transthoracic echocardiography is recommended for the assessment of myocardial structure and function, including measurement of LVEF (Class I, Level C).",
    "table_data": null,
    "section_id": "sec_3_2",
    "heading_level": null,
    "breadcrumb": "3. Diagnostic pathway for patients with suspected heart failure > 3.2. Echocardiography",
