    "content_hash": "756f982df7f520acb49598072bcaa9b2ff587d5d11b359dc584695a9a7b71c60",
    "text": "An ICD is recommended to reduce the risk of sudden death in patients with symptomatic HF (NYHA Class II-III) and LVEF <= 35% despite >= 3 months of OMT (Class I, Level A).",
